WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
[Music: original 120 BPM electronic score]
TILL — x402 settlement for the agent economy.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
[Terminal types; single click]
GET /r/demo answers 402 Payment Required.
The agent's signed payment is verified, guards pass, the upstream is served, and the settlement is confirmed.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
[Four UI ticks on the beat]
Verify. Guards. Upstream. Settle.
Nothing settles before your upstream answers.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
[Ledger rows land on the beat]
Payment in, payout out, swap succeeded, matched by transaction hash.
Append-only ledger. Bigint base units.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Payouts through NEAR Intents: paid in USDC on NEAR, paid out USDC on Ethereum.
Six reconciliation rules. Zero open.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
[Music resolves]
Charge agents by the request. Prove every payout.
Built at NEAR Hackathon 2026. Testnet trace, mock payout provider.
